{"text":"He said, imagine loving God so much that you would be willing to stand in an airport all day so that you could tell people about God's love. All day long people rushed past him even after he had forsaken his traditional saffron robes to mitigate first impressions. They buried their faces in their newspapers as soon as he started to speak and still he kept showing up because God's love was the greatest thing he had ever known and he wanted to share it.","words":[{"text":"He","start":0.0,"end":1.06},{"text":"said","start":1.06,"end":1.56,"punct":","},{"text":"imagine","start":2.76,"end":3.76},{"text":"loving","start":3.76,"end":5.68},{"text":"God","start":5.68,"end":6.18},{"text":"so","start":6.18,"end":7.56},{"text":"much","start":7.56,"end":8.08},{"text":"that","start":8.08,"end":9.14},{"text":"you","start":9.14,"end":9.44},{"text":"would","start":9.44,"end":9.64},{"text":"be","start":9.64,"end":9.86},{"text":"willing","start":9.86,"end":10.2},{"text":"to","start":10.2,"end":10.48},{"text":"stand","start":10.48,"end":10.98},{"text":"in","start":10.98,"end":11.46},{"text":"an","start":11.46,"end":11.62},{"text":"airport","start":11.62,"end":12.26},{"text":"all","start":12.26,"end":13.02},{"text":"day","start":13.02,"end":13.5},{"text":"so","start":13.5,"end":14.52},{"text":"that","start":14.52,"end":14.7},{"text":"you","start":14.7,"end":14.9},{"text":"could","start":14.9,"end":15.06},{"text":"tell","start":15.06,"end":15.34},{"text":"people","start":15.34,"end":15.74},{"text":"about","start":15.74,"end":16.12},{"text":"God's","start":16.12,"end":16.68},{"text":"love","start":16.68,"end":16.94,"punct":"."},{"text":"All","start":18.46,"end":19.04},{"text":"day","start":19.04,"end":19.44},{"text":"long","start":19.44,"end":20.16},{"text":"people","start":20.16,"end":21.56},{"text":"rushed","start":21.56,"end":21.96},{"text":"past","start":21.96,"end":22.38},{"text":"him","start":22.38,"end":22.68},{"text":"even","start":22.68,"end":23.06},{"text":"after","star